	(text_box "16 isolated PLC field positions use software-remapped logical channels to minimize PCB crossings. Dedicated E-stop, HOLD and START optochannels are separate connectors, not shift-register bits. PLC and control channels keep the 2.2 k series limit, indicator LED and reverse diode. U17's two used control channels use individual EL3H7 DIP-4 optocouplers U35/U36; PLC inputs use four LTV-847S SOIC-16W packages. Four 4x4.7 k isolated networks provide the PLC pull-ups and no input-node capacitor is fitted. Expansion bits 16-23 are split across two 1x6 headers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 15 0.0000)
		(size 190 45)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.127)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a9678934-0eed-407a-b290-50732626d5ba")
	)
	(text_box "FIELD COM 0/1 are isolated returns and have no copper connection to GND. Each bank uses one selector: external 24 V wetting or the internal protected isolated 12 V contact supply."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 390 200 0.0000)
		(size 140 35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.127)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fdf2c386-17da-4d58-a396-c1f8be170585")
	)
	(text_box "The dedicated E-stop, HOLD and START channels use individual EL3H7 DIP-4 optocouplers U35/U36/U39 and keep discrete 4.7 k pull-ups. PLC inputs use four LTV-847S packages with one isolated 4x4.7 k network per four-channel group. Every field input uses the same 2.2 k / indicator LED / reverse-diode chain. Firmware provides debouncing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 205 0.0000)
		(size 250 34)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.127)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
